<translate>
==== MaxHitCount ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The parameter determines the maximum number of targets that a player can hit with this weapon in one hit.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
MaxHitCount = 2,
</syntaxhighlight>
